  "description": "Hell's Anvil was the customized personal ship of the bounty hunter Montross. It featured two aft-mounted Dyne 427 radial atomizer engines, not to mention two custom Keizar-Volvec KV4T8-i sublight engines on the tip of each wing. Montross also installed a Longe Voltrans tri-arc CD-1.3 hyperdrive, a double-plated durasteel hull, and a multifaceted deflector shield array. Hell's Anvil was armed with solar ionization cannons, which evaded conventional deflector shields and melted durasteel.",
